<title>UK: UK's ECGD backs India power project.</title>
<headline>UK's ECGD backs India power project.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Export Credits Guarantee Department (ECGD) said on Monday it was guaranteeing a $22.85 million stg loan to Kvaerner Boving Ltd to supply capital goods for a major power project in India.</p>
<p>Kvaerner Boving Ltd has been awarded two contracts for the 1,500 megawatt Nathpa Jhakri hydro-electric power project in the Satluj River Basin in Himachal Pradesh.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Thatcher, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770</p>
</text>
